    {
        "content": "<p>This is very related to <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/33188\">#33188</a> by <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"758816\">@Bingyu Xia</span> . I am busy this week, but I promise a serious review next week.</p>",
