    {
        "content": "<p>Note that this will not be right for n=0: every time you hit <code>-</code> you should be thinking \"could this be a pathological operation\". You should restate with power series in n+1 variables being univariate power series over (power series in n variables).</p>",
        "id": 577317825,
        "sender_full_name": "Kevin Buzzard",
        "timestamp": 1772645773
    },
    {
